14
00:00:27,740 --> 00:00:31,760
A lying on of hands, fingers near the forehead, strong, making me whole.

15
00:00:32,040 --> 00:00:33,780
The holiness of myself released.

16
00:00:34,080 --> 00:00:35,900
I found God in myself and I loved her.

